Proprietary vendor firmware blobs for the SAZ1051 camera board
(Hi3516CV610 + OS05L10 sensor + WS73/Hi3873V100 USB WiFi).

The files under vendor/saz1051/ (MPP kernel modules, OS05L10 sensor
library/ini, WS73 WiFi driver + RF firmware, board init and majestic
config) are closed vendor artifacts redistributed here for build
reproducibility. They are not covered by the OpenIPC license and may
be subject to separate vendor terms.
